title: PPS and the Soviet Model
subtitle: The line of PPS towards the Soviet model of power.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_ussr_position.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.stanceAvailable(Q, 'ussr_position') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.ussr_position (catalogue 4.8; technical reference 10.10): 1 T, 0 R, the card then waits 12 months. Z — 0.51: the present line can be
// confirmed for 1 T and the usual wait; returning the card to the hand is free.
PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'ussr_position');
!}

= PPS and the Soviet Model

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration costs this month's action; it changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @sympathetic
- @independent
- @critical
- @easy_discard

@sympathetic
title: Solidarity with the Soviet state as an attempt to build socialism
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_sympathetic_present = 1 : This is the present line. Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_sympathetic_present = 0 : Relation with the KPP +5 once in the chapter; Centrum dissent +5. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'ussr_position', 'sympathetic').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_sympathetic_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'ussr_position', 'sympathetic');
!}
go-to: result

@independent
title: Independence: workers’ cooperation without the Soviet model
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_independent_present = 1 : This is the present line. Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_independent_present = 0 : No change of relations or dissent. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'ussr_position', 'independent').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_independent_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'ussr_position', 'independent');
!}
go-to: result

@critical
